# The cycle's motor (src/sound.c, sound_engine): records the game's sound (/out/sound.wav). Silent
# while the loop rides in the opening; then the three hits, and it's you riding: the hum winds up
# from low, holds at cruise, climbs as you boost (hold up), comes back down, and a turn's whoosh
# over it
record_sound
wait_boot
start_intro
press b
wait 3.5
wait 2
press left
wait 1
press up
wait 1
shot engine_0_broken
press right
wait 5
shot engine_1_cruise
keydown up
wait 1.2
shot engine_2_boost
keyup up
wait 2
press left
wait 1.5
shot engine_3_end
